{"t":"Braindeath Quest/Spoiler","s":"braindeath-quest-spoiler-6804c","k":"outro","i":"assets/wiki/Braindeath_Quest_dbe0df.png","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Braindeath Quest</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aka\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">None.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"log\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Log</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvl\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0<br/>(70+ recommended)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8.50<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 1, 2009<br/>Summer Update 2009</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Quests</nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-quest-legend\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Legend\">Legend</span></h3>\n<p>A brave adventurer died facing the evil Braindeath.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Fenrock\">Fenrock</a>, near <a href=\"#/wiki/Beregar\">Beregar</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-dangers\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dangers\">Dangers</span></h3>\n<p>On the way there: <a href=\"#/wiki/Rotworm\">Rotworms</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Carrion%20Worm\">Carrion Worms</a>, all kinds of <a href=\"#/wiki/Goblin\">Goblins</a><br/> In the quest area: <a href=\"#/wiki/Ghoul\">Ghouls</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Gozzler\">Gozzlers</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Bonelord\">Bonelords</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Elder%20Bonelord\">Elder Bonelords</a> and 1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Braindeath\">Braindeath</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-reward\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Reward\">Reward</span></h3>\n<p>A <a href=\"#/wiki/Red%20Backpack\">Red Backpack</a> with 2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Health%20Potion\">Great Health Potion</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Mana%20Potion\">Mana Potion</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Shovel\">Shovel</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Rope\">Rope</a>, and 13 <a href=\"#/wiki/Platinum%20Coin\">Platinum Coins</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-spoiler\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Method:\">Method:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Find your way to <a href=\"#/wiki/Beregar\">Beregar</a>, therefore use the transport system of <a href=\"#/quest/the-hidden-city-of-beregar-quest\">The Hidden City of Beregar Quest</a> (if completed) or run there.<br/></li>\n<li>After that follow the picture:<br/></li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Braindeath Quest\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Braindeath_Quest_dbe0df.png\" width=\"576\"/></span><br/>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Near the lava in part 5 is 1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Braindeath\">Braindeath</a>. After killing it open the right <a href=\"#/wiki/Coffins\">Coffin</a> in order to get your reward.</li></ul></div>","quests":[]}